{"synopsis":"Shin Haesu, seorang petugas kepolisian yang berspesialisasi di penaklukan kekerasan berlebih tiba-tiba mendapatkan kemampuan yang membuatnya dapat kembali ke 60 menit yang lalu. Dia tahu bahwa kematian Ayahnya adalah pembunuhan yang disamarkan sebagai bunuh diri. Haesu kemudian menjadi seorang polisi untuk menangkap dalang di balik pelaku pembunuhan ayahnya tersebut dan tiba-tiba mendapatkan kemampuan superpower tersebut ketika suatu kecelakaan misterius terjadi!\n\nBayangan besar secara perlahan mulai terlihat ketika Shin Haesu memecahkan kasus kriminal dan mengejar organisasi dalang pelaku!","alternative_title":"The Police Are Too Strong, 경찰이 너무 강함, The Overpowered Cop","author":"Kim Kise, Sson","artist":"Seongjun","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c3f3cc59-87eb-402a-a1b7-a295c057d15a","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2025-08-16","released":"2025-08-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5cc9bfef-59f0-4554-a827-bc6437a674c4","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2025-08-16","released":"2025-08-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7e3f42d4-59af-488f-aec3-fa764292c683","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2025-08-16","released":"2025-08-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b3f5225e-5acf-451b-9fcf-b74cf972298b","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2025-08-12","released":"2025-08-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"09936ad7-2ce3-4dc0-b54f-627dc7b6175c","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2025-08-12","released":"2025-08-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"17df1297-7955-48ac-a1af-ff612a4fac42","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2025-07-06","released":"2025-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"27b07347-8693-4d37-82a4-a6dea81c748a","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2025-07-06","released":"2025-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7a99620a-2b0c-45c5-abf6-9e881b015819","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2025-06-28","rele